      "headline": {
        "en": "Ares Capital to buy MidCap Financial Investment from Apollo for $2.6bn",
        "zh": "Ares Capital将以26亿美元从Apollo收购MidCap Financial"
      },
      "summary": {
        "en": "Ares Capital has agreed to acquire private credit fund MidCap Financial Investment (MFIC) from Apollo in a stock-and-cash deal at an enterprise value of about $2.6bn. MFIC shareholders will receive $10.88 per fully diluted share, comprising $1.21 in cash from an Ares Management subsidiary and $9.67 in Ares Capital stock. The deal, expected to close in the first half of 2027 subject to MFIC stockholder and regulatory approvals, is expected to be modestly accretive to Ares Capital's core earnings per share.",
        "zh": "Ares Capital已同意以约26亿美元的企业价值，通过现金加股票交易从Apollo收购私人信贷基金MidCap Financial Investment（MFIC）。MFIC股东每完全稀释股将获得10.88美元，包括来自Ares Management子公司的1.21美元现金和9.67美元的Ares Capital股票。该交易预计于2027年上半年完成，尚需MFIC股东及监管批准，预计对Ares Capital核心每股收益略有增厚。"
      },
