        "en": "Ares Capital to acquire MidCap Financial Investment Corp in $2.6 billion stock-and-cash deal",
        "zh": "Ares Capital将以约26亿美元股票加现金交易收购MidCap Financial Investment Corp"
      },
      "summary": {
        "en": "Ares Capital Corporation and MidCap Financial Investment Corporation announced a definitive merger agreement under which Ares Capital will acquire MFIC for a total enterprise value of approximately $2.6 billion. MFIC stockholders are expected to receive total consideration of $10.88 per fully diluted share, consisting of about $1.21 in cash and about $9.67 in Ares Capital stock, representing a 30.1% premium to MFIC's last closing price. Before closing, MFIC expects to declare and pay a special dividend of its undistributed taxable income, with the stock consideration reduced dollar-for-dollar.",
        "zh": "Ares Capital Corporation与MidCap Financial Investment Corporation宣布达成最终合并协议，Ares Capital将以约26亿美元的总企业价值收购MFIC。MFIC股东预计每股摊薄后获得总计10.88美元对价，包括约1.21美元现金和约9.67美元Ares Capital股票，较MFIC上一收盘价溢价30.1%。交割前，MFIC预计将宣布并支付特别股息，分配其未分配应税收入，股票对价将相应等额扣减。"
      },
